Console Kitchen public assets

The code of the Console Kitchen is licensed under the MIT license, see LICENSE at the
root of the repository. The files of this directory belong to their owners
and are used under the terms listed below.

appearance/
    Boot screens (bootlogo/), Nyx backgrounds (background/) and boot menu icons
    (icon/) for hekate and Nyx, redistributed under the licenses listed below.
    Boot screens were converted from the rotated bitmaps
    hekate expects to the orientation they are seen on screen, the icons of
    hekate from the bitmaps of Nyx to PNG with their transparency, the others
    rendered from SVG.

    */hekate-*.png              CTCaer, GPL-2.0
                                https://github.com/CTCaer/hekate
    */atmosphere-*.png          Atmosphère-NX, GPL-2.0
                                https://github.com/Atmosphere-NX/Atmosphere
    icon/mattera-*.png          Nichole Mattera, GPL-2.0, as stated for every icon
                                in its folder of the repository: the Atmosphère
                                one uses the logo by jaames for Atmosphère-NX, the
                                Switch and payload ones are redrawn after the Nyx
                                icons of CTCaer. Rendered from the SVG sources of
                                the repository fitted into the 192×192 icon of
                                Nyx, the white lockpick recolored from the colored
                                one; the fitted SVG files are in art/icons of the
                                repository of the Console Kitchen
                                https://github.com/NicholeMattera/Hekate-Icons
    icon/console-kitchen-*.png  Console Kitchen, MIT, drawn for the project, the SVG
                                sources are in art/icons of the repository
                                https://github.com/arebaka/console-kitchen

assets/
    Product photos of the Nintendo Switch consoles from the Nintendo online
    store (nintendo.com). Nintendo Switch, its logos and the photos are
    trademarks and copyrighted works of Nintendo. They only illustrate the
    console revisions, the Console Kitchen is not affiliated with Nintendo.

    Photos of the PSP models from Wikimedia Commons, trimmed to the console
    and scaled down, the adaptations are under the licenses of the originals.
    PlayStation Portable, PSP and their logos are trademarks of Sony
    Interactive Entertainment, the Console Kitchen is not affiliated with Sony.

    psp-1000.avif               Evan-Amos, public domain
                                https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Sony-PSP-1000-Body.png
    psp-2000.avif               Evan-Amos, public domain
                                https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:PSP-2000-trans.png
    psp-3000.avif               Evan-Amos, CC BY-SA 3.0
                                https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:PSP-3000-Silver.png
    psp-go.avif                 Evan-Amos, CC0
                                https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:PSP-Go-FL-Open.png
    psp-street.avif             Tokyoship, CC BY 3.0, rendered from the SVG
                                https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:PSP_E1000_illustration.svg

